    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d326">

                <pb facs="0349" n="343" xml:id="pg343"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123M956/385: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at Algiers
                        (Cole)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-07-24T21:00:00-04:00">July 24, 1942—9
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>220. For Murphy. If you were ordered home for a brief period of consultation do
                    you believe that you would have any difficulty in returning to North Africa?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
